e</code> observation MUST\\nNOT authorize resume.\\n\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3078,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 770,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
