{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d16f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c3b6-e69d-7952-b5c2-99ff4034d208"},"sequence":1810,"recorded_at":1780531400003615,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"5d75c7b3-ca89-4158-8f1c-936a31a9dfe8","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"5d75c7b3-ca89-4158-8f1c-936a31a9dfe8","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"5d75c7b3-ca89-4158-8f1c-936a31a9dfe8"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c3c5-e7cb-7fd0-af9f-39ab62c8395f"},"task_id":"01a0c3c5-e7cb-7fd0-af9f-39ab62c8395f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c3c5-e7cb-7fd0-af9f-39ab62c8395f","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-26-1\",\n  \"command\": \"PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py N-broker-uid N-override-tmpdir N-collision-inherited N-collision-tmuxenv N-collision-tmpdir N-collision-conventional N-collision N-argv-tmuxenv N-argv-shape N-containment-symlink-verify N-platform-windows N-fchmod-umask N-acquire-commit-refusal N-acquire-verify-refusal 2>&1 | tail -n 20\",\n  \"description\": \"Smoke-test remaining new mutants\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"ok: N-fchmod-umask: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly non-root creates past the explicit post-mkdirat chmod; root creates still chmod. Kill path: under umask 0177 the leaf stays 0600 and the mode gate refuses. Non-root load-bearing, like the same-shaped reviewer plant. [exit 1]\\nok: N-containment-symlink-verify: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly symlink leaves via an ELOOP fallback open on the verify side; the commit side still refuses. Kill path: Verify follows the leaf and the mode gate passes on the target. [exit 1]\\nok: N-platform-windows: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the C: fixture root past the lexical Windows refusal; every other Windows root still refuses there. Kill reroutes to the host arm, which reports runtime platform host instead of runtime platform. [exit 1]\\nok: N-override-tmpdir: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the TMUX_TMPDIR value as an override — the member tmux uses to relocate its default socket directory; the other four vectors still refuse. [exit 1]\\nok: N-collision: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the default-path collision; collisions on the other four ambient members still refuse. [exit 1]\\nok: N-collision-inherited: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the inherited-socket collision; the other four members still refuse. [exit 1]\\nok: N-collision-tmuxenv: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the TMUX-env collision; the other four members still refuse. [exit 1]\\nok: N-collision-tmpdir: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the TMUX_TMPDIR collision; the other four members still refuse. [exit 1]\\nok: N-collision-conventional: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the conventional-name collision; the other four members still refuse. [exit 1]\\nok: N-broker-uid: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the seam-shifted foreign UID past the same-user arm; every other foreign UID still refuses. [exit 1]\\nok: N-acquire-commit-refusal: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly commit-phase custody refusals past the foreground wiring (commit failures carry the joined path; lexical failures carry \\\"\\\"); lexical refusals still refuse. Kill path: the entry probes and spawns past a widened mode. [exit 1]\\nok: N-acquire-verify-refusal: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly mode refusals past the background verify wiring; absence and every other custody refusal still refuse. Kill path: the entry contacts the broker past a widened mode. [exit 1]\\nok: N-argv-tmuxenv: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the TMUX environment value at the spawn-socket arm; every other ambient socket still refuses. [exit 1]\\nok: N-argv-shape: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly our tmux-headed spawn vector past the landed shape wiring; any other vector still refuses. Other failing shapes are unstageable through the fixed-shape builder and are disclosed, not pinned. [exit 1]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2842,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 711,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
