rator caller past the vocabulary arm; every other unknown caller still refuses. Kill reroutes to the dependencies refusal. [exit 1]\\nok: N-details-remediation: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly remediation-less requests past the typed-details arm; generation- and broker-less still refuse. Kill reroutes to the dependencies refusal. [exit 1]\\nok: N-unattested-foreground: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly generation-refused running servers to attach past the foreground wiring; membership refusals still refuse. Kill path: a stale admission attaches instead of refusing. [exit 1]\\nok: N-acquire-commit-refusal: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly commit-phase custody refusals past the foreground wiring (commit failures carry the joined path; lexical failures carry \\\"\\\"); lexical refusals still refuse. Kill path: the entry probes and spawns past a widened mode. [exit 1]\\nok: N-acquire-verify-refusal: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly mode refusals past the background verify wiring; absence and every other custody refusal still refuse. Kill path: the entry contacts the broker past a widened mode. [exit 1]\\nok: N-spawn-swallow: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the fixture spawn failure as success; every other spawn failure still reports. [exit 1]\\nok: N-probe-swallow-foreground: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the fixture probe failure as an absent server (then spawns); every other probe failure still passes through. [exit 1]\\nok: N-probe-swallow-background: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the fixture probe failure as a broker miss (then reports unavailable); every other probe failure still passes through. [exit 1]\\nok: N-argv-socket: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the default path at the spawn-socket arm; every other ambient socket still refuses. [exit 1]\\nok: N-argv-tmuxenv: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the TMUX environment value at the spawn-socket arm; every other ambient socket still refuses. [exit 1]\\