al passes, 91.6% package coverage, full 30-command suite green (race in 6 bounded groups, 45/45 packages, no DATA RACE), tmux-hidden suite green with 0 SKIP. Candidate left UNCOMMITTED on the story branch at base `799c338`; `internal/traceability` untouched.","reason":null}}
